      "id": "claim_9818cf7782de446aa5b658b7c14c5154",
      "statement": "Python modules live in one package per subsystem under Python/, which is itself the import root rather than a package, so a module is addressed by a dotted path such as pfnn.runtime and every consumer must put that directory on sys.path; Unity does it in PythonRuntime.EnsureInitialized and each test file does it for itself.",
